<title>PHILIPPINES: Pryce gas unit sets 1.0 bln peso capex.</title>
<headline>Pryce gas unit sets 1.0 bln peso capex.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pryce Gas Inc, a subsidiary of Pryce Properties Inc, said on Friday it would invest 1.0 billion pesos to build 27 liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) refilling stations in the southern Mindanao island.</p>
<p>The refilling plants will have the capacity to store up to 3,900 tonnes of LPG which will be marketed in the central Visayan islands and the southern Mindanao island, documents submitted to the energy department said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
